### Health
GET http://localhost:18080/health

### Create order
POST http://localhost:18080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "symbol": "RELIANCE",
  "side": "BUY",
  "order_type": "LIMIT",
  "quantity": 100,
  "price": 145050,
  "idempotency_key": "demo-order-001"
}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:18080/api/orders

### Get positions
GET http://localhost:18080/api/positions

### Get P&L
GET http://localhost:18080/api/pnl?user_id=1&symbol=RELIANCE

### Get risk
GET http://localhost:18080/api/risk?user_id=1

### Update risk limits
PUT http://localhost:18080/api/risk/limits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "max_order_quantity": 1000,
  "max_position_quantity": 2000,
  "max_notional": 10000000
}
